		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Pourquoi pas quelque chose comme</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT id_ilot, count(*) FROM (
    SELECT id_ilot, regexp_matched(sequence, &#039;tour&#039;, &#039;g&#039;)
